WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.181 --> 00:00:04.900
Meet Tapfour Connect.
One stand, one app.

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.218
Pick your stand:
three designs, two finishes.

3
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.336
Paste your Google Maps link,
and see what guests get.

4
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.650
A guest taps,
and your Google review opens.

5
00:00:21.214 --> 00:00:22.210
No app to download.

6
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:27.919
Scan for your live menu.
Sold out? The next scan shows it.

7
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:35.307
Add table ordering, and orders pop up
at the counter, then go to the kitchen.

8
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.688
See every tap, and your busiest hours.

9
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.721
Change a link once,
and every stand follows.

10
00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.612
Five stands and the app:
₱3,000 once, ₱299 a month.

11
00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:53.053
No time? We build it for you.

12
00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.388
Tapfour Connect.
Build yours, just below.
